{
  "name": "30 · Interview Scheduler (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 30 · Interview Scheduler\nMark a candidate **shortlisted** in your sheet (agent 29 does this) → it finds a free 45-minute slot in your Google Calendar (weekdays, no clashes), books it with a Google Meet link, emails a friendly invite and marks the row **invited**.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Candidates**: Name, Email, Phone, Role, Status, Interview.\n2. Google Calendar node: add a **Google Calendar OAuth2** credential.\n3. Gmail nodes: add a **Gmail OAuth2** credential.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nEdit TIMES in **Pick free slots** for your interview hours.",
        "height": 574,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "d0742333-81f6-41fd-8b51-3cb68abe30db",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
